        "text": "This chunk is about:\n- People: Roger Yuan, Tom Dey\n- Films: Once Upon a Time in Vietnam, Shanghai Noon, Failure to Launch, Marmaduke\n- Organizations: The New York Times\n\nFacts:\n- Roger Yuan starred in Once Upon a Time in Vietnam.\n- Roger Yuan also appeared in Shanghai Noon.\n- Shanghai Noon was the directorial debut of American film director Tom Dey.\n- Tom Dey’s other directing credits include Failure to Launch and Marmaduke.\n- Tom Dey also had a credit connected to The New York Times.",
