        "original_id": "44220482-1006-5716-b4a0-d11f951dc13b",
        "text": "This chunk is about:\n- People: Tom Dey, Alfred Gough, Miles Millar, Roger Yuan, Dustin Nguyen, Jackie Chan, Chow Yun-fat\n- Films: Shanghai Noon, Showtime, Failure to Launch, Marmaduke, Bulletproof Monk, Batman Begins, Skyfall, Once Upon a Time in Vietnam\n- Roles: director, screenwriter, producer, actor\n\nFacts:\n- Tom Dey, born April 14, 1965, is an American film director, screenwriter, and producer.\n- Shanghai Noon marked the directorial debut of Tom Dey.\n- Alfred Gough and Miles Millar wrote Shanghai Noon.\n- Roger Yuan appeared in Shanghai Noon (2000) opposite Jackie Chan.\n- Roger Yuan appeared in Bulletproof Monk (2003) alongside Chow Yun-fat.\n- Roger Yuan appeared as the technician in Batman Begins (2005).\n- Roger Yuan appeared as Severine's bodyguard in Skyfall (2012).\n- Once Upon a Time in Vietnam is a 2013 Vietnamese action fantasy film directed by Dustin Nguyen and starring Dustin Nguyen along with Roger Yuan.\n- Tom Dey's credits include Shanghai Noon, Showtime, Failure to Launch, and Marmaduke.",
        "type": "TextSummary"
      },
      {
